OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 18 DEC
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GMark Forrest introduces an
OL,6,     Gafternoon of of specially made
OL,7,     Grecordings from the Belfast
OL,8,     GInternational Arts Festival plus
OL,9,     Gthe theme of dance continues with
OL,10,     GStravinsky.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Prokofiev
OL,12,     GKate Molleson explores
OL,13,     GProkofiev's American dreams, a
OL,14,     Gfantastical opera, and a love
OL,15,     Gstory that changed his life.
OL,16,G1700FIn Tune
OL,17,     GPetroc Trelawny is joined in
OL,18,     Gstudio by pianist Isata Kanneh-
OL,19,     GMason. The BBC Singers perform
OL,20,     Gfestive repertoire live from
OL,21,     GMaida Vale, London.
